{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"自由环路空间"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"自由环路空间"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>生象</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的<strong>自由环路空间</strong> (free loop space) $\\mathcal L X$ 是 $S^1$ 到 $X$ 的映射生象\n$$\r\n\\mathcal L X = \\mathsf{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(S^1,X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>由于 $S^1$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":" $S^1 = *\\sqcup_{*\\sqcup *} *$, 有\n$$\r\n\\mathcal LX = X\\times_{X\\times X}X.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ 的自由环路空间 $\\mathcal L\\mathbf{B}G$ 是 $G$ 关于自身的"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":"的商:\n$$\r\n\\mathcal L\\mathbf{B}G = G /_{\\mathrm{ad}} G.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}